# Nauss instances solved without an initial upper bound, with tentative upper bounds: the root is solved first, then
# the problem is solved with ub = LB + 10, LB + 14, LB + 18, ... (LB = root lower bound) until a solution is found.
# Tip: after a batch execution, call 'grep statistics: out/nauss-tentative.out -h | cut -c13-' to get the results as rows for a LaTeX table.
# julia src/run.jl -b nauss-tentative.batch &> out/nauss-tentative.out
